  title: First instruction
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8db74389b8c31914dbe8c9c4cf3c818b, type: 2}
  mailText: "\"Hello dear employee,\n\nFor today put any employee who made the following
    mistakes in <b> <color=red>formation </b></color>\n\n<size=30>Requierment :</size>\n\nSchedule
    :\n- Took more than 1 hour of pause in Total\n- Took a pause longer than 30 mintute\n-
    Arrived before 8:30 am or after 9 am \n- Left after 16:30 am.\n\nHealth grading
    :\n- Has no A's in any of the H.E.A.L.T.H categories.\n- Has more the 3 E's in
    any of the H.E.A.L.T.H categories.\"\t\t"
